# Invoicing24 Frontend Rules

Tech Stack:
- Angular 19
- TypeScript
- Angular Material
- Reactive Forms
- RxJS
- Standalone Components

Rules:
- Use standalone components only.
- Prefer Angular Signals for local state.
- Use Reactive Forms instead of Template Driven Forms.
- Follow Angular style guide.
- Use strongly typed interfaces.
- Avoid using any type.
- Use OnPush change detection when possible.
- Keep business logic inside services.
- Use Angular Material components.
- Follow existing folder structure.
- Create reusable shared components when duplication is detected.
- Use RxJS operators instead of nested subscriptions.
- Add proper error handling for API calls.
- Generate clean and maintainable code.
- Do not modify unrelated files.

Code Style:
- Use meaningful variable names.
- Add comments only when business logic is complex.
- Keep functions small and focused.
- Prefer readonly properties where possible.